WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:03.460
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.400
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.970
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.910
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:23.930
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.370
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:31.140
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.420
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.860
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:45.450
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.910
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:49.980
I can say love

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:53.710
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.710
will you love me?

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:57.320
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.270
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:03.830
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:08.480
is like the midnight sun.

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:09.700
What was that...

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:10.670
Dunno...

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:13.170
It's Seina. Happens all the time.

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:15.070
Oh...

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:16.860
Morning.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:22.910
Seina and Tenchi

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:27.770
I'm so lonely I'm shaking!

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:31.140
You were just playing around, pretending to leave me all alone, right?!

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:33.540
Why do you treat me so, Yoshiko-san?!

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:42.950
Whoa! I went up those hills in no time flat...!

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:45.610
So this is how effective body enhancement is...

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:53.490
Look! The house next to that lake is where your mom is, Fuku!

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:58.370
Your mom's name was Washu-san, right?

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:01.200
I think I've met most of the people at Tenchi-senpai's house,

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.970
but I don't think I've ever seen her before...

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:08.670
Oh well! I'm sure Sasami-chan or Noike-san will introduce us to her!

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:11.080
Super speed, go!

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:14.710
I've changed! I've really changed!

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:27.290
I let my guard down...

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:28.520
You okay?

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.630
Tenchi-senpai!

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.000
Long time no see!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:37.440
I see you haven't changed a bit, Seina-kun.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.240
Good morning...

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.470
Did you sleep well?

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:42.810
Yes, thank you...

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:45.210
You can rest a little longer if you'd like!

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.180
We all stayed up rather late last night!

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.380
You certainly are bright and cheerful, ma'am...

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:51.790
Ungh...

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.690
It's good to see you again, Tenchi-senpai!

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:55.820
You look like you're doing well!

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:59.120
Ryo-Ohki-chan. Thanks for coming to our rescue the other day.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:04.770
I was surprised when Airi-san mentioned you joining the GP!

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:08.200
Is she really your grandmother?

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:09.000
Yeah, she is.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.870
Doesn't it seem strange when you think about it, though?

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:13.970
She's so young but she's an actual grandmother...

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:17.310
I'm used to it. And besides, she doesn't like it when I call her Grandma...

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:18.870
Don't call me Grandma!

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:24.020
Come to think of it, how is everyone else doing?

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:27.890
Oh, they're doing fine, maybe a little too much so...

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:33.960
Oh, a person named Washu Hakubi lives with you, right?

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.330
Oh yeah, you haven't met any of them before, have you?

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:42.270
No, but Sasami-chan and Noike-san often come into town to shop...

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:45.640
Ryoko-san sometimes drops by to buy sake...

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:48.070
And I've met Ayeka-san on several occasions!

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.280
Now that I think about it, Sasami-chan's also mentioned a Mihoshi-san,

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:53.010
but I've never met her either...

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:57.620
Mihoshi-san's a 1st class GP detective and always out in space working,

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:01.020
so she hardly ever goes into town.

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:04.660
Washu-chan always hides herself in a lab inside my house.

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:05.760
Oh yeah!

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.960
I want to let Fuku see Washu-san,

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.230
plus I'd like to thank her myself for giving us her latest ship...

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.630
My, how thoughtful of you!

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.970
W-who are you...?

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:19.910
Washu Hakubi-chan!

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:22.040
You are?

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:24.310
You're the most brilliant scientist in the universe...?

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:27.980
That's right! I'm Washu-chan!

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.850
Fuku's mother?

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.790
But she's so little...!

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:36.250
Would you believe me if I were like this?

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:49.170
Looks like everything's in tip-top shape!

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:51.610
Don't act so childish...

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:55.060
You have to hurry and grow up into a responsible adult.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.610
Are you even listening to me?

00:05:57.610 --> 00:06:00.780
What am I ever going to do with you?

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:02.350
Not you too, Ryo-Ohki...

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:04.820
What's the matter with you two?

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:09.450
Watching you and Ryo-chan, it's almost like she's your daughter...

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:12.380
Oh, you mean you don't know?

00:06:15.260 --> 00:06:16.590
She transformed!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:27.100
Oh! She's the one Sasami-chan always carries around...!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:34.450
Each day brings a new disaster...

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:36.650
What're you doing! Knock that off, you two!

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:40.450
Ryo-Ohki! You can have one carrot! You can have one too, Fuku-chan.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:44.380
I see.

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:48.200
So does that mean Fuku can change into human form too?

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:51.430
She has the ability.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.900
It all depends on how she's raised, though.

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:55.840
I see...

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.370
Just raising her normally is enough on your part.

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:02.640
She'll change if she deems it necessary, so just take it easy!

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:04.580
Okay...

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:10.620
But be careful, she'll wind up like my other daughter if you mess up.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:12.850
Eh? Your other daughter...?

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:15.840
You know her very well.

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:17.680
I do...?

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:24.860
Heya!

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:26.400
You seem pretty enthusiastic.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:30.440
Practicing for your future life and career here, are you?

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:33.210
I'm only doing it in return for their hospitality.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:36.200
Looks like she's full of the same attitude herself.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.750
She does, doesn't she?

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.650
Welcome!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:48.920
Tenchi-chan!

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.120
Sasami-chan!

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:53.760
Oh, Seina-chan!

00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:55.990
It's good to see you again! You look well!

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:59.200
I was worried when I heard you went into outer space!

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.100
Sorry for making you worry...

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.300
Can you spend time here today?

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:04.600
Yeah! It's no problem!

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:05.970
That's great!

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:08.610
Oh yeah, I brought some snacks!

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:11.080
But there might not be enough...

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:18.920
Who's this?! She looks just like Ryo-chan!

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:20.990
This is Ryo-Ohki's little sister!

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:23.060
So she's from that one time...?!

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:25.260
They've named her Fuku-chan.

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:27.060
Oh, really? She's so cute!

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:30.090
She looks just like Ryo-chan when she was little!

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:36.430
Fuku-chan, Ryo-chan! I made some carrot sandwiches!

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.910
Here you go, Fuku-chan, Ryo-chan!

00:08:42.910 --> 00:08:44.570
Well? Is it yummy?

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:48.880
That's good! Have some more then!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:51.690
I can make you some more if there's not enough!

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:53.090
Here you go!

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.950
Looks like things will work out just fine...

00:08:56.920 --> 00:08:59.090
Tenchi-sama.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:00.360
Noike-chan!

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:04.200
Seina-chan's here! And so is Ryo-chan's little sister!

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:05.870
Hello!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:09.130
Hello, Seina-san. It's a pleasure to see you again.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.960
Welcome!

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:18.680
So you're Seto-sama's granddaughter, Sasami-chan?

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:23.240
And Noike-chan is my grandma's adopted daughter. So she's my aunt!

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:27.190
It must be difficult having to deal with Seto-sama all the time...

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:30.420
Yeah, it is kind of tough...

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:33.220
But thanks to you she's stopped bothering me!

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:36.900
Utsutsumi-sama told me the same thing...

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:38.800
I thought he would...

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.300
Oh, yes, Seina-dono!

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:45.040
Could I check your personal data later on? Airi-dono asked me if I would.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.970
Sure, no problem.

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:48.880
All finished loading up.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:53.350
Then do you suppose you could go get Ayeka-san and Ryoko-san?

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:55.620
Over by the shrine? Alright.

00:09:55.620 --> 00:09:57.720
Say, why don't you come with me, Seina-kun?

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.920
I don't know if it will actually work for you,

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:03.090
but how about trying a Shinto ceremony to drive away your bad luck?

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:06.530
Sure. It has been a while since I've seen the priest...

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.660
Okay, then I'll hold onto Fuku for you!

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:09.760
Thanks!

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:12.430
Tenchi-senpai! Do you mind if I go on my bike?

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:14.800
I'm pretty amazing, you know.

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:18.000
I dunno, having seen your skydiving stunt just now...

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.110
Okay, why don't we have a race then?

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:22.470
I'm not so bad myself!

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:27.450
He's fast!

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:31.220
Darn it! I refuse to lose!

00:10:31.220 --> 00:10:33.480
Seina-kun! That way leads to a...!

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.820
Oh my...

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:44.690
You're the same as ever you were, young man!

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.010
Entrance to the store is now by special admission only!

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:01.880
Please refrain from pushing!

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:04.320
Please don't push! Line up and wait your turn!

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:07.550
It's good to see you again!

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:11.490
I hear your luck is as terrible as ever, even in space.

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:14.050
Yes, well...

00:11:15.960 --> 00:11:16.900
What is it?

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:19.420
I thought I just heard someone call my name...

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:21.900
Are you alright?

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:24.640
Tenchi and I are the only others here.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:27.570
Eh? But I heard someone else's voice...

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:31.140
Ah, so you are able to hear it?

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:34.480
The one speaking to you is...

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:40.620
A royal tree...

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:43.920
That's right. It's greeting you.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.690
It's good to meet...

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:48.390
Wait, we already know each other, I used to play here all the time!

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:52.630
Hey, Tenchi, listen to this!

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:55.400
You won't believe what Ayeka's...

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:00.930
Good to see you again...

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:05.750
Oh, Seina! Long time no see! How ya doing?

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:06.950
Sorry 'bout that!

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.350
I didn't see you there!

00:12:09.350 --> 00:12:10.450
But it's your fault too!

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:13.890
You didn't say a word so how was I supposed to know you were there?

00:12:13.890 --> 00:12:18.260
Well, it is hot today so I understand why you'd wanna play in the water...

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:19.860
Fuku-chan's older sister.

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:22.160
Eh?

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:26.800
Ryoko-san is Washu-san's daughter?!

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:30.440
Eh? But... Hold on a sec...

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:31.910
Does that mean she can...

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:34.010
Ryoko-san! Ryoko-san!

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:36.580
Where are you, Ryoko-san? Come out!

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.380
Oh, crap!

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:42.120
Lazy Ryoko-san, ditching her cleaning duties... Now where did she go...?

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.920
Huh?

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.320
It's you...

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:51.120
Oh, Seina-san! It is a pleasure to see you again.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.460
It's good to see you too!

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:57.930
I am glad to see that you are doing so well!

00:12:57.930 --> 00:13:01.470
I have been hearing a lot about you from Seto-sama.

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:03.960
About all your heroic deeds and...

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:10.040
Yoshiko-san...! I was so lonely!

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:12.610
He's a cute dog, don't you think?

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:14.600
Dog?!

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:24.360
Oh, yes! You also know of the secrets of space.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.360
Allow me to tell you something interesting.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:28.360
I assume you've heard of the old legend

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:31.630
in which the warrior sealed away the evil demon, correct?

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:34.190
You told it to me countless times, sir.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.840
The truth is...

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:40.810
...I was the young man who sealed it away.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.440
And...

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.110
...that is the sealed demon!

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:45.040
Hi!

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:46.380
Huh...?

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:49.520
About 2 years ago, Tenchi went and broke the seal...

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:50.320
Eh?!

00:13:50.320 --> 00:13:54.620
Then she went on a rampage in Kurashiki; the damage was unbelievable.

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:58.160
Then that gas explosion at Kurashiki West High was because of...

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:00.350
That would be me!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.000
And the disappearance of Tenchi-senpai's house

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.730
and the destruction of the surrounding area...?!

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:08.500
That was Ayeka. She also demolished the Seto Bridge while she was at it.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:11.340
You were responsible for what happened to the Seto Bridge!

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:14.440
--You suddenly wanted a fight!
--Even the mysterious destruction

00:14:14.440 --> 00:14:17.310
--It was your fault!
--of the Seto Bridge...?!

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:19.010
Tenchi-sama. Seina-san.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:22.950
Tell the other girls to come here

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:25.940
so that I can hold bad luck removal ceremonies for them.

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:32.020
With any luck it will help protect them from your own misfortune.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.660
What about my ceremony?

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:38.860
There's no point, your bad luck is far too strong.

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:41.930
--Seina-san!
--Seina-kun!

00:14:42.470 --> 00:14:43.940
Seina-kun! Are you alright?!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.270
Seina-san!

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:49.340
See what I mean?

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:58.750
Finished, at last...

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.420
That was really amazing...

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:04.060
Speaking of amazing, why doesn't this planet have any security posted

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:07.290
if there are members of the royal family living here?

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.430
Is security really necessary?

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:13.070
Ayeka-sama's 2nd-generation Juraian warship, Ryu-Oh.

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:16.070
Noike's 3rd-generation ship, Kyoko.

00:15:16.070 --> 00:15:19.140
Sasami-sama's original royal tree, Tsunami.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.310
Ryoko's pirate ship, Ryo-Ohki.

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:24.080
The galaxy's greatest genius, Professor Washu.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.750
And then there's Mihoshi Kuramitsu.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:31.920
Yosho-sama's 1st-generation ship, Funaho, is doing well too...

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:32.950
And...

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.080
And...?

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:38.990
No, I've just heard that Tenchi-sama also has special powers of his own...

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:42.600
Would you have wanted to fight them all, Ryoko?

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:46.030
If I had the slightest inkling I would have stayed as far away as possible.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:50.040
But shouldn't there at least be some surveillance?

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:53.470
Oh! So that's what Tarant was...!

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.780
Tarant? What about him?

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:57.680
I don't know the details,

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:01.580
but I think he tried to use Seina-sama's family as hostages!

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:02.350
So what happened?!

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:03.850
During this one meeting I noticed that he had been injured,

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:07.620
and they were also discussing something about a plan along those lines...

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:10.380
His plan must have backfired on him.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:14.530
Against a group powerful enough to wage war against the entire galaxy,

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:15.720
there was naturally only one possible outcome!

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.330
Please forgive me.

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.570
It's okay! It happens to me all the time!

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:24.540
Plus I've undergone body enhancement, so I'm not hurt or anything!

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:26.940
Ayeka's just terrible, isn't she?

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.170
Ryoko!

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:31.980
Go on and have a bath before dinner's ready.

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:34.080
I'll prepare your change of clothes.

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:36.320
No, that's all right, I should be leaving soon...

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.550
I thought you weren't in a hurry?

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:39.790
Come on, it's been a while since you were last here...

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:40.920
O-okay...

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:42.990
Alright! Let's go then!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:44.390
Huh? Go where...?!

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:49.560
What an amazing bathhouse! When did you build this here?

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:51.460
Yeah, you can't see it from the outside.

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:53.630
I'd say we built it about 2 years ago or so...

00:16:55.870 --> 00:17:00.510
The curtain on the front said women and Tenchi...

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:03.810
Well, I'm the only man here, so...

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:05.810
I've been wanting to ask you for a while now,

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:08.410
but your dad lives in Kurashiki, right?

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:11.120
He remarried Reina-san, his assistant.

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:13.620
He lives in a new house now.

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:16.090
Your priest grandfather lives at the shrine.

00:17:16.360 --> 00:17:18.860
Yeah, that's right...

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:20.360
Tenchi-senpai.

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:23.260
There really aren't any other men around here, are there?

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:25.930
Well... no...

00:17:25.930 --> 00:17:31.170
Say, Airi-san tells me you're living with Kiriko-san!

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:34.660
Along with Amane-san and some former pirate...

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:38.740
I-it wasn't really my idea...

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.280
It must be pretty tough...

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.010
Yes...

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:43.740
I know the feeling.

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:48.620
Heya, Seina! Want me to scrub your back?

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:53.160
Ryoko! I told you to stop suddenly appearing like that!

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.760
Did I scare you?

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:57.460
You've been acting more and more like Washu-san lately!

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:00.670
Now leave!

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:02.100
Yeah, okay...

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.810
Don't be nervous, just relax.

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:10.170
Okay...

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:13.180
Alright, then.

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:14.440
Here goes.

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:20.220
Now this is something!

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:21.720
What is it?

00:18:21.720 --> 00:18:24.760
A simulation using your personal data.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:28.230
I thought I would verify the data Airi-dono gave me,

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:30.730
but it turns out you really are perfect for a decoy!

00:18:30.730 --> 00:18:34.270
I bet the reason you met Ryo-Ohki near Jurai is because...

00:18:34.270 --> 00:18:35.740
Is because...?

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:38.600
...is because she's a pirate ship.

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:42.210
She was drawn there by you, Seina-dono.

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:45.110
Hey! It looks like there's going to be a lot of people tonight,

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:46.880
so we're going to have nabe!

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:48.950
We've finished preparing the ingredients,

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:51.980
so I'll leave the cooking up to you, Tenchi-sama.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.040
Sure thing. Just leave it to me!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:02.660
Um... Do you need help with anything?

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.130
When he's cooking nabe you're supposed to stay quiet and watch!

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:06.260
I see...

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.800
You are absolutely unbelievable!

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:12.770
All I'm gonna do is give him some of my special sake...

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:14.970
Seina-sama is underage, you know!

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:17.370
Would you listen to me, Ryoko-san...

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:34.730
What's that sound?

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:35.690
Done!

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.800
Okay, I'll start serving everyone's rice then...

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:43.740
Oh, wow!

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:45.470
I'm so sorry!

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:49.610
I'm alive again!

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:51.840
Seina-sama certainly is taking a long time...

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:54.450
I imagine they have a lot of catching up to do...

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:57.250
Yeah! So let's take it easy and relax too!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:01.350
But it's always at times like this that urgent matters come up...

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:03.890
What is it?

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:06.990
An order from the Galaxy Police Headquarters to return to port.

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:11.660
If they're giving orders to us, does that mean something happened nearby?

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:14.670
These orders are of the highest priority level!

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:15.790
Let's hurry!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:22.960
"Waitress"

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:26.540
Okay! It's time!

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:32.620
Wow! Chicken! I haven't had that in a long time!

00:20:32.620 --> 00:20:34.620
All the meat's mine!

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:35.920
Hold on just a minute!

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.290
You snooze, you lose!

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:39.430
Quiet!

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:40.560
Okay, then...

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:43.600
--We humbly accept...
--Seina-chan!

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:45.590
K- Kiriko-san...?

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:52.740
It's a pleasure to see you all again!

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:54.540
I'm sorry for barging in like this, but it's an emergency!

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:56.510
Oh! Amane!

00:20:56.510 --> 00:20:58.100
Hey there, Mihoshi...

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:03.320
Amane!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.450
It's so good to see you again! Ama
--

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.650
Don't hold them up, they're in a hurry.

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:10.290
Ouchie...

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.290
Come on, Seina-chan! Hurry!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.190
Eh? But I still haven't had any chicken...!

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:16.430
We've got an emergency meeting to get to!

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:18.300
Come on! Let's go!

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:19.730
My chicken...!

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:24.900
Hang in there! Don't give up!

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:27.970
Come visit again anytime you want!

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.970
Well, it was nice seeing you!

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:37.750
My... my chicken...!

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:40.180
Good luck, Seina-kun...

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:47.130
Shuttle dock confirmed! Preparations to depart are complete!

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:48.490
We have a clear course!

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:52.470
We'll be taking a course through hyperspace with engines at full power!

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:53.970
I thought she was just playing with me,

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:56.000
but she was actually treating me like a dog...!

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:57.370
My heart...

00:21:57.370 --> 00:21:58.970
My chicken...!

00:21:58.970 --> 00:22:00.640
Give back my...

00:22:00.640 --> 00:22:01.470
...chicken...!

00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:02.370
My...

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:03.140
My...

00:22:03.140 --> 00:22:04.310
My...!

00:22:04.310 --> 00:22:05.610
My...!

00:22:05.610 --> 00:22:07.310
Gimme back my chicken!

00:22:07.310 --> 00:22:09.080
Wait, what's chicken?

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:27.020
You're the worst, most hopeless,
most unlucky boy in all of space...

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:34.890
Even against your will...
(You fail.)

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.700
Even when you're gentle...
(You're extremely clumsy.)

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:41.200
With too much fighting spirit,
in vain, it's all coming to nothing...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:44.190
You're gonna fail.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.040
Carefully...
(So irritating!)

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:50.040
Or with violence...
(Ow! Quit it!)

00:22:50.040 --> 00:23:01.110
You're the worst and most hopeless...
you're a lost cause.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:10.830
You're the worst and the most hopeless...

00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:15.170
You're an unlucky boy...

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:20.510
But, any way, I'm with you.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:25.670
So, more and more,
keep on doing what you do!

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:34.660
A pirate fleet has started wreaking havoc throughout Juraian territory.

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:36.520
Its name is the Good Luck Fleet?

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:38.690
Our orders to seek and destroy it are fine and everything,

00:23:38.690 --> 00:23:41.700
but don't tell me it's the one that just appeared in front of us!

00:23:41.700 --> 00:23:43.700
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:43.700 --> 00:23:45.460
Those Who Bear Good Fortune
